   "id": "lead-2",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "It publishes articles in Arabic, French, English and Turkish, and is run primarily on a volunteer basis by an editorial team, and an expanding pool of contributors that includes academics, journalists, activists and artists.",
   "words": 34,
