   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-2",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "These include an academic research journal (est. 1992), a documentary film collective (2003), and a publishing house (2012).",
