  {
   "id": "sec2-3",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "According to Haddad (a founder of ASI) Jadaliyya originated in 2002 with the intent to create \"a publication that would have a wider circulation\" than the scholarly, peer-reviewed Arab Studies Journal.",
   "words": 32,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 6"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    30,
    2
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 525876863,
