  },
  {
   "id": "sec3-6",
   "section": "Response",
   "text": "Jadaliyya has quickly become the go-to place for information and analysis of what is going on in Egypt and the region.",
   "words": 22,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
