   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec3-8",
   "section": "Response",
   "text": "It seems to provide solutions to many problems we have been engaged with in anthropology -- the production of knowledge in and about the region, particularly in this time of the massive uprisings … Jadaliyya has been the place where some of the best \"ethnographic\" writing about the region in this time of incredible transformation and change is to be found.",
   "words": 59,
