  {
   "id": "sec3-9",
   "section": "Response",
   "text": "Media outlets such as The Atlantic, The Christian Science Monitor, The Chronicle of Higher Education, The Guardian,Inter Press Service,La Stampa, London Review of Books, The New York Times, NPR, and PBS referenced Jadaliyya when discussing events related to the Arab Uprisings, as well as the Middle East more generally.",
