   "section": "Response",
   "text": "The Guardian stated that \"the Arab [Studies] Institute’s Jadaliyya website is an invaluable resource\", while Al-masry Al-youm (English Edition) suggested that it \"quickly became a port of call for many wanting to understand the tumultuous events unfolding across the region\" by offering \"more nuanced, in-depth coverage than most, but without the delays and exclusivity of academic journals.\"",
