  {
   "id": "sec4-1",
   "section": "Book",
   "text": "The Dawn of the Arab Uprisings: End of an Old Order?, was edited Haddad, Bsheer, and Abu-Rish.",
   "words": 18,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
