   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec4-5",
   "section": "Book",
   "text": "She also argues that it will be \"a much-treasured volume for undergraduate students, and its sophistication will also benefit postgraduates and academics.\"",
